 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the year that King Uzziah died",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I saw the Lord seated on a high and lofty throne",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the train of his robe filled the temple",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Above him stood seraphim, each with six wings",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Holy, holy, holy is the LORD of hosts",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole earth is full of his glory",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Holy, holy, holy is the LORD of hosts",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole earth is full of his glory",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The doorposts of the thresholds shook",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the house was filled with smoke",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Woe to me! I am ruined",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For I am a man of unclean lips",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And my eyes have seen the King, the Lord of all",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then one of the seraphim flew to me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Holding a glowing coal",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He touched my mouth with it and said",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "See, this has touched your lips",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Your guilt is taken away, and your sin is atoned for",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I heard the voice of the Lord saying",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Whom shall I send? And who will go for us?",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I said, Here I am. Send me!",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here I am. Send me!",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So he went out to a people who would hear but never understand",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spoke of a virgin's son, a sign from the Lord's own hand",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of a child who would be born to us, the Prince of Peace",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was pierced for our transgressions",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And by his wounds we are healed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Holy, holy, holy is the LORD of hosts",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole earth is full of his glory",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here I am. Send me!",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 14.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  }
